        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f05b48/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-14T15:47:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>On the original Spite, yes, but we are talking about the Agent of Gloom version...</p><p>Of course, I agree that in the original Spite, the drugs are just drugs.</p><p>To be clear, what I said (the drugs being representations of evil blessings, yadayadayada) applies only to Agent of Gloom Spite, not the original. Thought that was clear.</p>",
