      {
        "id": 86508,
        "name": "abredon",
        "username": "abredon",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/c57346/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-31T18:49:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Twice, but once was in error. (the error was advanced, and we timed something wrong)When we did pull it off: &nbsp;(This Sunday)(H) was 5, we had Fixer, Tempest, Scholar, Bunker and Wraith. &nbsp;Opening hands included Stratosphere, Reclaim and infared Eyepiece. &nbsp;So boom, drug to the bottom of the deck.Scholar draws DDA, so Tempest and Scholar put Strat back in play round 2, and there were only three drugs in play. &nbsp;Two rounds later we got 4 victims in the safehouse and worked for four or five more rounds to get to all the drugs face down on the table, then we flipped him.Second side Spite with 0 drugs face up isn't such a challenge, but once we realized we could do it, we had to try.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>How did you get all his drugs face down? In reading his card, the best you can do is break even.</p>\n<p>At the start of the Villain turn, either there are H cards under the Safe House or he flips a drug face up.</p>\n<p>At the end of the Villain turn, if there are more cards in the Safe House than drugs in play, flip a drug face down.</p>\n<p>Net effect: the same number of drugs face up as at the start of the turn (unless all drugs were face up at the start of the turn.)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I haven't seen the ruling about face-down indestructible cards, and search didn't help - can you point it out?</p>",
        "post_number": 29,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:10:31.144Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
