      {
        "id": 86515,
        "name": "jason_kratz",
        "username": "jason_kratz",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/7c8e57/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-03T00:24:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Matchstickman wrote:</b><br><blockquote>The idea of using Into the Stratosphere comes from the question \"Are cards still indestructible when they are face down?\"\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nAnd the short answer: no\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>What about use of Cedistic Dissonant? It would put the drug in the trash, but does it go face up when you put it in the trash, and hence come back? Or is it still textless?</p>",
        "post_number": 36,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:10:31.673Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
